Error [E0068]: This callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/range_dispatch_missing_else.jet:3:22
    |
  3 | fn grade(score: Int) => String {
    |                      ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`

Error [E0307]: this `if` over `Int (a whole number)` has no `else` arm — range arms can't cover every value
  --> tests/ui/range_dispatch_missing_else.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     if score == {
    |     ^^
 Why: `Int (a whole number)` has infinitely many values; range arms only cover a subset
 Fix: add `else -> { … }` to handle values not matched by any range
